  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0: runs against SQLite, PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server, in-memory, LiteDB and LiteGraph (no skipped cases on full-capability backends); resolver and transaction API updates (CancellationToken on resolver methods, AmbientTransactionScope); AOT-annotated IConformanceTarget.",
